\begin{align*}
\sum_{cyc} \dfrac{ab}{c+1} &=\sum_{cyc}\dfrac{(ab)^2}{abc+ab}
&\ge \dfrac{(ab+bc+ac)^2}{3abc+ab+bc+ca}
&=\dfrac{9}{3abc+3}
