<details><summary>A, B, R collinear proof</summary>I'm just going to copy the diagram from the wiki:

[asy]
size(0,5cm);
pair a=(8,0),b=(20,0),t=(14,0),m=(9.72456,5.31401),n=(20.58055,1.77134),p=(15.15255,3.54268),q=(4.29657,7.08535),r=(26,0);
