\tfrac{1}{16}+\tfrac{15}{32}h_1
\end{align*} 
so  $h_1=\tfrac{2}{17}$  and  $h_{-1}=\tfrac{1}{17}.$  Our answer is   $$ \frac{1}{2}\left(\frac{2}{17}+\frac{1}{17}\right)=\boxed{\frac{3}{34}}. $$

